  "title": "Qt: Add Copy > ...as Hex Array",
  "description": "Add the ability to copy hex data in the format:\n\n  0x12, 0x34, 0x56, 0x78\n\nThis is useful for pasting packet data into source code in languages\nwhere strings are not appropriate storage for byte data. It does not\ninclude any array delimiters because some languages use { } and others\nuse [ ]; it is expected that the user is pasting into an pre-started\narray.",
